{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>即炸即上!任食博多直送明太子</p><p>日本九州知名天婦羅店登港！</p><p>日本九州知名天婦羅專門店博多天ぷらやまや（ Hakata Tempura Yamaya）即將登陸香港，選址銅鑼灣全新地標港島壹號中心。品牌主打「即炸即上」的用餐模式，食客可近距離欣賞廚師在吧台前即席炸製天婦羅，再將熱騰騰的炸物逐件奉上，確保入口時仍保持最佳酥脆度。</p><p>天婦羅口感輕薄鬆脆！</p><p>店內的天婦羅麵衣講求輕薄鬆脆，減少油膩感，讓食材的原味更突出。餐廳亦以自家特製的「美味高湯」沾醬、海鹽等搭配方式，讓客人可按個人口味自由選擇，品嚐不同層次的鹹香與鮮味。</p><p>無限任食博多直送明太子！</p><p>最吸引的莫過於定食套餐可無限任食博多直送的辛辣明太子及辛辣高菜，既保留九州食堂的親切感，也增添濃厚的當地風味。延續品牌在日本九州的地道精神，帶到香港餐桌上。</p><p>博多天ぷらやまや（ Hakata Tempura Yamaya） 地址：銅鑼灣告士打道281號港島壹號中心�備註：預計今年第四季盛大開幕</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521843110379716_20810724516a68457f842a3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521843333818855_4318121586a684581c07a9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521843515452391_5137398916a68458387664.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521843691046590_9096413106a6845854b97d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521843853961393_18013986616a6845871a1f4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521844063652027_9255159256a68458924e8f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521844244633832_15714463986a68458b310be.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521844453262597_17816589566a68458cdd1e1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178521844613673593_11898928296a68458ebe65d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T06:21:31.852798+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}